🇪🇸 What's happening in Spain didn't happen by accident.

Mass amnesty and weak border enforcement encouraged more illegal migration, just as similar policies did in the United States. The solution starts with enforcing the law and securing the border.

@WatchfulWaiter1 is a Senior Research Fellow at the Border Security and Immigration Center at The Heritage Foundation.

